OL,3,ASpaceX to attempt double catch of huge
OL,4,AStarship rocket
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpaceX will attempt to catch both parts
OL,7,Fof its huge Starship rocket after it
OL,8,Flaunches on its next test flight on
OL,9,FFriday.
OL,11,FElon Musk's company will use the
OL,12,Fmechanical arms - nicknamed chopsticks
OL,13,F- on its launch tower to grab the
OL,14,Frocket parts mid-air as they return to
OL,15,FEarth.
OL,17,FIf successful, this will be the first
OL,18,Ffull recovery of a rocket that's been
OL,19,Fto space, paving the way for making
OL,20,FStarship reusable so it can fly
OL,21,Frepeatedly.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
